('item-35', 'usr-seller-7', 'cat-otomotif', 'Honda PCX 160 CBS 2023 Pearl Jasmine White Km Rendah 6.200 Mulus', 'honda-pcx-160-cbs-2023-pearl-jasmine-white', 'Dijual motor matic bongsor Honda PCX 160 CBS tahun 2023 warna Pearl Jasmine White (Putih Mutiara). Odometer 6.200 km asli pemakaian harian santai dalam kota. Bodi mulus 97% terawat no jatuh/lecet parah, mesin 160cc 4 katup eSP+ sangat halus dan bertenaga. Surat lengkap BPKB, STNK faktur asli, kunci keyless cadangan ada. Pajak aktif.', 26500000, 33500000, 1, 25000000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 410, 9, 58, 'Jawa Timur', 'Malang', 'Klojen', '65111', 1, 'Mall Olympic Garden (MOG) Malang / Alun-alun Kota', '{"engine":"160cc 4-Katup eSP+ PGM-FI","transmission":"CVT Otomatis","keySystem":"Honda Smart Key System (Keyless)","odometer":"6.200 km"}', '2026-08-31T08:00:00Z', '2026-08-31T08:00:00Z'),
('item-36', 'usr-seller-7', 'cat-otomotif', 'Honda CBR250RR SP Quick Shifter 2022 Racing Red Mulus Pajak Hidup', 'honda-cbr250rr-sp-quick-shifter-2022-racing-red', 'Motor sport fairing 250cc 2 silinder terbaik Honda CBR250RR SP Quick Shifter livery Racing Red. Mesin 41 PS bertenaga dengan fitur Throttle By Wire (3 riding mode: Comfort, Sport, Sport+) dan Assist/Slipper Clutch. Kondisi fisik 98% terawat selalu parkir garasi tertutup. Odometer 7.400 km. Ban tebal, oli rutin Motul 300V.', 54000000, 79800000, 1, 51500000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2022, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 650, 14, 88, 'Jawa Timur', 'Malang', 'Lowokwaru', '65141', 1, 'Matos Malang / Suhat Malang', '{"engine":"249.7cc 8-Valves Liquid-Cooled Parallel Twin","features":"Quick Shifter, Assist & Slipper Clutch, TBW 3 Riding Modes","power":"41 PS / 30 kW @ 13.000 rpm","odometer":"7.400 km"}', '2026-08-31T09:30:00Z', '2026-08-31T09:30:00Z'),
('item-37', 'usr-seller-7', 'cat-otomotif', 'Honda CB650R Neo Sports Cafe 2021 Matte Gunpowder Black Km 5.100', 'honda-cb650r-neo-sports-cafe-2021-matte-black', 'Moge naked Honda CB650R 4 silinder bersuara merdu khas inline-4. Warna favorit Matte Gunpowder Black Metallic. Odometer asli baru 5.100 km, surat lengkap plat L Jawa Timur faktur form A lengkap. Suspensi Showa SFF-BP terawat, ban Michelin Road 5 masih berbulu tebal.', 215000000, 298000000, 1, 205000000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2021, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 820, 6, 110, 'Jawa Timur', 'Malang', 'Klojen', '65111', 1, 'Ijen Boulevard Malang / Cafe Soekarno Hatta', '{"engine":"649cc 16-Valve DOHC Inline 4-Cylinder","transmission":"6-Speed with Assist & Slipper Clutch","suspension":"Showa 41mm SFF-BP Inverted Forks","odometer":"5.100 km"}', '2026-08-31T11:00:00Z', '2026-08-31T11:00:00Z'),
('item-38', 'usr-seller-2', 'cat-laptop', 'ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED (UX3402) Intel Core i7-1360P 16GB / 1TB Ponder Blue', 'asus-zenbook-14-oled-ux3402-i7-1360p-16gb-1tb-blue', 'Laptop ultra-portabel premium ASUS Zenbook 14 OLED (UX3402VA). Layar 14 inci 2.8K 90Hz OLED 100% DCI-P3 akurasi warna PANTONE Validated sangat tajam dan memanjakan mata. Bobot tipis 1.39 kg bahan aluminium militer MIL-STD 810H. Baterai awet 75Wh, audio Harman Kardon Dolby Atmos. Fullset charger 65W dan sleeve case.', 13800000, 19999000, 1, 12900000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 490, 11, 65, 'Jawa Barat', 'Bandung', 'Coblong', '40132', 1, 'Ciwalk Bandung / Starbucks Dago', '{"processor":"Intel Core i7-1360P (12 Cores, up to 5.0 GHz)","ram":"16 GB LPDDR5","storage":"1 TB M.2 NVMe PCIe 4.0 SSD","display":"14.0\" 2.8K (2880 x 1800) OLED 90Hz 100% DCI-P3","weight":"1.39 Kg"}', '2026-08-31T12:15:00Z', '2026-08-31T12:15:00Z'),
('item-39', 'usr-seller-5', 'cat-laptop', 'ASUS TUF Gaming A15 FA507 Ryzen 7 7735HS RTX 4060 16GB / 512GB 144Hz', 'asus-tuf-gaming-a15-fa507-ryzen-7-rtx-4060-16gb-512gb', 'Laptop gaming tangguh standar militer ASUS TUF Gaming A15 (FA507NV) warna Jaeger Gray. Ditenagai prosesor AMD Ryzen 7 7735HS dan kartu grafis NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 8GB GDDR6 TGP maksimal 140W dengan MUX Switch + NVIDIA Advanced Optimus. Kondisi fisik 96% mulus terawat, sistem pendingin kipas Arc Flow ganda dingin stabil.', 14900000, 21499000, 1, 14000000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 570, 15, 79, 'Banten', 'Tangerang Selatan', 'Serpong', '15322', 1, 'Summarecon Mall Serpong / Living World Alam Sutera', '{"processor":"AMD Ryzen 7 7735HS (8 Cores / 16 Threads)","gpu":"NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4060 8GB GDDR6 140W","ram":"16 GB DDR5-4800 Dual Channel","storage":"512 GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD","screen":"15.6\" FHD 144Hz 100% sRGB G-Sync"}', '2026-08-31T14:00:00Z', '2026-08-31T14:00:00Z'),
('item-40', 'usr-seller-2', 'cat-laptop', 'ASUS ROG Strix SCAR 16 Intel Core i9-13980HX RTX 4080 32GB / 1TB Mini-LED', 'asus-rog-strix-scar-16-i9-13980hx-rtx-4080-32gb-1tb', 'Monster gaming laptop flagship ASUS ROG Strix SCAR 16 (G634JZ). Performa tanpa kompromi Intel Core i9-13980HX (24 core) dan RTX 4080 12GB TGP 175W. Layar ROG Nebula HDR Mini-LED 2.5K 240Hz dengan 1024 local dimming zones dan kecerahan puncak 1100 nits. Fullset box original, adaptor 330W, Armor Caps.', 34500000, 52999000, 1, 32500000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 780, 8, 115, 'Jawa Barat', 'Bandung', 'Coblong (Dago)', '40132', 1, 'Paris Van Java Mall / Starbucks Dago', '{"processor":"Intel Core i9-13980HX (24 Cores / 32 Threads)","gpu":"NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4080 12GB GDDR6 (TGP 175W)","ram":"32 GB DDR5-4800 Dual Channel","storage":"1 TB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD","display":"16\" QHD+ 240Hz ROG Nebula HDR Mini-LED 1100 nits"}', '2026-08-31T15:20:00Z', '2026-08-31T15:20:00Z'),
('item-41', 'usr-seller-6', 'cat-elektronik', 'Mesin Cuci Front Loading LG 8.5kg AI DD Inverter FV1285S3VS Steam White', 'mesin-cuci-front-loading-lg-8-5kg-ai-dd-inverter-fv1285s3vs', 'Mesin cuci bukaan depan LG 8.5 kg seri AI DD™ Inverter Direct Drive FV1285S3VS warna Putih elegan. Teknologi sensor AI DD mendeteksi berat dan kelembutan kain secara otomatis untuk siklus pencucian paling optimal dan merawat pakaian. Fitur LG Steam™ membasmi 99.9% alergen dan tungau debu. Bodi 96% mulus, tabung stainless bersih bebas kerak.', 4750000, 7499000, 1, 4400000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 390, 6, 44, 'Jawa Tengah', 'Semarang', 'Semarang Tengah', '50132', 1, 'Mall Ciputra Semarang / Simpang Lima (Siap Ambil di Rumah)', '{"capacity":"8.5 Kg Front Loading","technology":"AI DD Inverter Direct Drive with LG Steam","spinSpeed":"1200 RPM Variable","smartFeatures":"Smart ThinQ Wi-Fi Connectivity"}', '2026-08-31T16:40:00Z', '2026-08-31T16:40:00Z'),
('item-42', 'usr-seller-6', 'cat-elektronik', 'Mesin Cuci LG 2 Tabung Twin Tub 10kg Roller Jet Pulsator P1000RT Dark Gray', 'mesin-cuci-lg-2-tabung-twin-tub-10kg-p1000rt', 'Mesin cuci 2 tabung kapasitas besar LG 10 kg tipe P1000RT. Dilengkapi Roller Jet Pulsator dan 3 program cuci (Gentle, Normal, Strong) yang mengoptimalkan pencucian tanpa merusak pakaian. Pengeringan cepat Wind Jet Dry dengan putaran kencang. Bodi anti karat dilapisi plastik tebal tahan benturan. Kondisi 95% pemakaian rumahan apik.', 1850000, 2799000, 1, 1650000, 'USED_GOOD', '["UNIT_ONLY"]', 2023, NULL, 0, 'ACTIVE', 310, 5, 32, 'Jawa Tengah', 'Semarang', 'Banyumanik', '50269', 1, 'Transmart Setiabudi Semarang / Ambil Langsung di Rumah', '{"capacity":"10 Kg Wash / 6.5 Kg Spin Dry","pulsator":"Roller Jet Pulsator 3-Way Action","drying":"Wind Jet Dry High Speed","body":"Rust-Proof Durable Plastic Body"}', '2026-08-31T17:30:00Z', '2026-08-31T17:30:00Z'),
('item-43', 'usr-seller-1', 'cat-otomotif', 'Sepeda Lipat Brompton M6L Racing Green Black Edition 6 Speed Original', 'sepeda-lipat-brompton-m6l-racing-green-black-edition', 'Sepeda lipat ikonik Inggris Brompton M6L seri Racing Green dengan part aksen Black Edition yang langka. 6 transmisi speed gear Shimano Brompton internal hub sangat nyaman untuk tanjakan maupun cruising perkotaan. Lipatan presisi rapat dan mudah dibawa ke dalam MRT atau bagasi mobil. Kondisi 96% mulus no retak no karat. Nomor seri frame terdaftar resmi.', 27500000, 38500000, 1, 25800000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2022, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 680, 12, 92, 'DKI Jakarta', 'Jakarta Selatan', 'Kebayoran Baru', '12130', 1, 'Senayan City / Blok M Plaza', '{"frame":"Handmade Steel in London","gears":"Brompton Wide Range 6-Speed (2x3)","handlebar":"M-Type Classic Handlebar","colorway":"Racing Green with Black Edition Accents"}', '2026-08-31T18:15:00Z', '2026-08-31T18:15:00Z'),
('item-44', 'usr-seller-7', 'cat-otomotif', 'Sepeda Road Bike Polygon Strattos S5 Shimano 105 22-Speed Carbon Fork', 'sepeda-road-bike-polygon-strattos-s5-shimano-105', 'Road bike endurance Polygon Strattos S5 Disc (Size 50 / S cocok untuk tinggi badan 165-175 cm). Groupset lengkap Shimano 105 R7000 2x11 Speed shifting presisi renyah. Fork depan berbahan ACX All-Rounder Carbon menyerap getaran aspal dengan sangat nyaman. Bodi 95% mulus rutin diservis dan cuci detailing di Rodalink. Bonus pedal cleat Shimano & bottle cage.', 11500000, 17200000, 1, 10500000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 460, 8, 57, 'Jawa Timur', 'Malang', 'Klojen', '65111', 1, 'Rodalink Malang / Ijen Boulevard', '{"frame":"ALX All-Round Endurance Alloy with Internal Routing","fork":"ACX Carbon Fork with Tapered Steerer","groupset":"Full Shimano 105 R7000 2x11 Speed","wheelset":"Entity Tubeless Ready Alloy 700c"}', '2026-08-31T19:00:00Z', '2026-08-31T19:00:00Z'),
('item-45', 'usr-seller-7', 'cat-otomotif', 'Sepeda MTB Giant Talon 1 29 Inch Shimano Deore 10-Speed Hydraulic Disc', 'sepeda-mtb-giant-talon-1-29-inch-shimano-deore', 'Sepeda gunung hardtail Giant Talon 1 Black Edition ukuran roda 29 inci (Frame M). Drivetrain Shimano Deore 1x10 speed dengan clutch Shadow RD+ rantai aman dari lonjakan di jalur off-road. Suspensi angin SXC32-2 RL dengan remote lockout di handlebar. Rem hidrolik Tektro HD-M275 sangat pakem. Pemakaian santai jalan aspal dan taman kota, belum pernah disiksa ke trek tanah becek.', 6800000, 10500000, 1, 6200000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 380, 7, 46, 'Jawa Timur', 'Malang', 'Lowokwaru', '65141', 1, 'Matos Malang / Velodrome Malang', '{"frame":"ALUXX-Grade Aluminum Disc","fork":"Giant SXC32-2 RL 29\" Air Spring 100mm with Remote Lockout","drivetrain":"Shimano Deore M5120 1x10 Speed","brakes":"Tektro HD-M275 Hydraulic Disc Brakes"}', '2026-08-31T20:10:00Z', '2026-08-31T20:10:00Z'),
('item-46', 'usr-seller-4', 'cat-fashion', 'Sepatu Converse Chuck 70 High Top Black White Egret Size 42 / US 8.5 Original', 'sepatu-converse-chuck-70-high-top-black-white-size-42', 'Sneakers legendaris Converse Chuck Taylor All Star 70 High Top Black/Egret original beli di official store PT MAP Aktif Adiperkasa. Bahan kanvas tebal premium 12oz, jahitan samping retro khas Chuck 70, sol glossy egret dengan insole OrthoLite super empuk. Kondisi 93% pemakaian santai, outsole logo bintang utuh. Dus original bawaan lengkap.', 750000, 1199000, 1, 650000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 420, 8, 51, 'DI Yogyakarta', 'Yogyakarta', 'Gondokusuman', '55223', 1, 'Plaza Ambarrukmo / Galeria Mall Jogja', '{"size":"42 EUR / US 8.5 / 27 CM","material":"Heavy-grade 12oz Vintage Canvas Upper","colorway":"Black / Egret / White","insole":"OrthoLite Cushioning"}', '2026-08-31T21:00:00Z', '2026-08-31T21:00:00Z'),
('item-47', 'usr-seller-4', 'cat-fashion', 'Sepatu Running Adidas Ultraboost Light Core Black Size 43 / US 9.5 Original', 'sepatu-running-adidas-ultraboost-light-core-black-size-43', 'Sepatu lari flagship paling empuk Adidas Ultraboost Light warna Core Black. Menggunakan material Light BOOST 30% lebih ringan dengan pengembalian energi kinetik maksimal di setiap langkah. Upper PRIMEKNIT+ membungkus kaki dengan pas tanpa lecet. Outsole karet Continental Rubber masih tebal 95%. Dus box original adidas lengkap.', 1650000, 3300000, 1, 1500000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 540, 11, 72, 'DI Yogyakarta', 'Yogyakarta', 'Depok Sleman', '55281', 1, 'Pakuwon Mall Jogja / GSP UGM', '{"size":"43 1/3 EUR / US 9.5 / 27.5 CM","cushioning":"Light BOOST Midsole with LEP 2.0 System","outsole":"Continental™ Better Rubber Outsole","colorway":"Core Black / Cloud White"}', '2026-08-31T21:45:00Z', '2026-08-31T21:45:00Z'),
('item-48', 'usr-seller-4', 'cat-fashion', 'Sepatu Vans Old Skool Black White Classic Skate Size 41 / US 8.5 Original', 'sepatu-vans-old-skool-black-white-classic-skate-size-41', 'Sepatu casual skate klasik sepanjang masa Vans Old Skool Black/White. Original jaminan 100% kode waffle DT. Bahan kombinasi suede halus dan kanvas kuat dengan sidestripe putih legendaris. Insole bersih tidak berbau, outsole waffle karet gum masih tebal mencengkeram. Dus box original Vans disertakan.', 620000, 1099000, 1, 550000, 'USED_GOOD', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 0, 'ACTIVE', 360, 7, 43, 'DI Yogyakarta', 'Yogyakarta', 'Kotagede', '55172', 1, 'Jogja City Mall / Malioboro Mall', '{"size":"41 EUR / US 8.5 Women (US 7.0 Men) / 26.5 CM","material":"Durable Suede and Canvas Upper","outsole":"Signature Rubber Waffle Outsole","colorway":"Black / True White"}', '2026-08-31T22:30:00Z', '2026-08-31T22:30:00Z'),
('item-49', 'usr-seller-4', 'cat-fashion', 'Sepatu Nike Air Max 90 White Black Infrared Size 42.5 / US 9 Original', 'sepatu-nike-air-max-90-white-black-infrared-size-42-5', 'Sepatu sneakers ikonik era 90an Nike Air Max 90 OG. Unit bantalan udara Max Air di tumit yang legendaris memberi kenyamanan pegas di tiap langkah. Bahan upper kombinasi leather, mesh, dan panel TPU khas Air Max. Bodi bersih terawat 95% minim lipatan. Fullset dus original Nike Sportswear.', 1250000, 2199000, 1, 1100000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 470, 9, 61, 'DI Yogyakarta', 'Yogyakarta', 'Depok Sleman', '55281', 1, 'Pakuwon Mall Jogja / Plaza Ambarrukmo', '{"size":"42.5 EUR / US 9 / 27 CM","cushioning":"Visible Max Air Unit in Heel with Foam Midsole","outsole":"Rubber Waffle Outsole with Flex Grooves","colorway":"White / Black / Infrared"}', '2026-08-31T23:15:00Z', '2026-08-31T23:15:00Z'),
('item-50', 'usr-seller-9', 'cat-gadget', 'Samsung Galaxy Z Flip 5 5G 8GB / 256GB Mint SEIN Resmi Mulus Like New', 'samsung-galaxy-z-flip-5-5g-8gb-256gb-mint-sein', 'HP lipat compact Samsung Galaxy Z Flip 5 5G warna Mint garansi resmi SEIN Indonesia. Layar cover Flex Window 3.4 inci sangat berguna untuk balas pesan dan selfie kamera utama. Engsel Flex Hinge rapat tanpa celah lipatan. Kondisi 98% like new pemakaian cewek sangat hati-hati, layar lipat Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz no crease cacat. Fullset box kabel ori.', 8800000, 15999000, 1, 8300000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 620, 14, 85, 'Sumatera Utara', 'Medan', 'Medan Barat', '20111', 1, 'Sun Plaza Medan / Center Point Medan', '{"chipset":"Snapdragon 8 Gen 2 for Galaxy","ram":"8 GB","storage":"256 GB UFS 4.0","screens":"6.7\" Dynamic AMOLED 2X 120Hz + 3.4\" Super AMOLED Flex Window","waterResistance":"IPX8 Water Resistant"}', '2026-09-01T08:00:00Z', '2026-09-01T08:00:00Z'),
('item-51', 'usr-seller-3', 'cat-gadget', 'Xiaomi 13T 12GB / 256GB Leica Camera Alpine Blue Garansi Resmi TAM Mulus', 'xiaomi-13t-12gb-256gb-leica-camera-alpine-blue', 'Smartphone Xiaomi 13T hasil kolaborasi resmi dengan kamera legendaris Leica. Warna Alpine Blue dengan back cover BioComfort vegan leather yang sangat mewah dan nyaman digenggam. Lensa Leica Vario-Summicron 50MP menghasilkan tone warna Leica Authentic & Vibrant yang khas. Layar CrystalRes AMOLED 144Hz 2600 nits. Fullset charger cepat 67W asli.', 4950000, 6499000, 1, 4600000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 510, 10, 68, 'Jawa Timur', 'Surabaya', 'Gubeng', '60281', 1, 'Tunjungan Plaza / Grand City Surabaya', '{"camera":"Leica Professional Optical 50MP Triple Camera with OIS","chipset":"MediaTek Dimensity 8200-Ultra (4nm)","display":"6.67\" 144Hz CrystalRes AMOLED HDR10+ Dolby Vision","charging":"67W Turbo Charging in 42 Mins"}', '2026-09-01T09:10:00Z', '2026-09-01T09:10:00Z'),
('item-52', 'usr-seller-1', 'cat-gadget', 'iPad Air 5 64GB Wi-Fi Starlight Chip Apple M1 Mulus Fullset iBox', 'ipad-air-5-64gb-wi-fi-starlight-apple-m1', 'Apple iPad Air Generasi ke-5 chip Apple M1 kencang setara MacBook. Warna Starlight sangat elegan dan mewah. Layar Liquid Retina 10.9 inci dengan True Tone dan gamut warna P3. Kamera depan Ultra Wide 12MP dengan Center Stage otomatis mengikuti wajah saat video call. Kondisi mulus 97% pemakaian browsing & baca buku di rumah. Fullset dus dan adaptor 20W bawaan.', 7450000, 10999000, 1, 6950000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 440, 8, 59, 'DKI Jakarta', 'Jakarta Selatan', 'Cilandak', '12430', 1, 'Cilandak Town Square (CITOS) / One Belpark', '{"chipset":"Apple M1 Chip (8-Core CPU & 8-Core GPU)","storage":"64 GB Internal","display":"10.9\" Liquid Retina with True Tone and Antireflective Coating","touchId":"Top Button Touch ID"}', '2026-09-01T10:30:00Z', '2026-09-01T10:30:00Z'),
('item-53', 'usr-seller-1', 'cat-gadget', 'Apple Watch Ultra 2 Titanium 49mm GPS Cellular Ocean Band Orange Resmi iBox', 'apple-watch-ultra-2-titanium-49mm-ocean-band-orange', 'Smartwatch petualang paling tangguh Apple Watch Ultra 2 casing Titanium 49mm garansi resmi iBox Indonesia. Layar Retina OLED Always-On 3000 nits paling terang di bawah terik matahari. Chip S9 SiP dengan gestur Double Tap inovatif dan GPS presisi frekuensi ganda (L1 dan L5). Baterai tahan hingga 36 jam (72 jam low power mode). Fullset dus kabel magnetic fast charger.', 11200000, 15999000, 1, 10500000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 680, 13, 94, 'DKI Jakarta', 'Jakarta Selatan', 'Kebayoran Baru', '12130', 1, 'Gandaria City / Pacific Place SCBD', '{"caseSize":"49mm Aerospace-Grade Titanium","brightness":"3000 Nits Always-On Retina Display","connectivity":"GPS + Cellular LTE with Dual-Frequency GPS","waterResistance":"100m Water Resistant with Depth Gauge & Water Temp"}', '2026-09-01T11:45:00Z', '2026-09-01T11:45:00Z'),
('item-54', 'usr-seller-2', 'cat-laptop', 'Dell XPS 13 Plus 9320 Intel Core i7-1360P 16GB / 512GB SSD OLED 3.5K Platinum', 'dell-xps-13-plus-9320-i7-1360p-16gb-512gb-oled', 'Laptop ultra-futuristik Dell XPS 13 Plus 9320 warna Platinum Silver. Desain minimalis tanpa sela dengan zero-lattice keyboard dan trackpad haptic kaca tanpa batas. Layar sentuh 13.4 inci OLED 3.5K (3456x2160) DisplayHDR 500 dengan warna hitam pekat tak tertandingi. Ditenagai prosesor Core i7-1360P 12 core bertenaga. Bobot hanya 1.23 kg. Unit mulus 97% terawat.', 16900000, 28500000, 1, 15800000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 430, 7, 62, 'Jawa Barat', 'Bandung', 'Coblong', '40132', 1, 'Ciwalk Bandung / Paris Van Java', '{"processor":"Intel Core i7-1360P (12 Cores, up to 5.0 GHz)","ram":"16 GB LPDDR5 6000MHz","storage":"512 GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe SSD","display":"13.4\" 3.5K (3456x2160) OLED Touch 400 nits 100% DCI-P3","weight":"1.23 Kg"}', '2026-09-01T12:50:00Z', '2026-09-01T12:50:00Z'),
('item-55', 'usr-seller-5', 'cat-laptop', 'Monitor Gaming LG UltraGear 27GP850-B 27" QHD Nano IPS 165Hz G-Sync Compatible', 'monitor-gaming-lg-ultragear-27gp850-b-27-qhd-nano-ips-165hz', 'Monitor gaming jawara LG UltraGear 27GP850-B ukuran 27 inci resolusi tajam QHD (2560x1440). Panel Nano IPS 1ms GtG dengan refresh rate 165Hz (overclock hingga 180Hz) dan cakupan warna DCI-P3 98% bersertifikasi VESA DisplayHDR 400. Kompatibel dengan NVIDIA G-Sync dan AMD FreeSync Premium. Layar bersih no dead pixel no backlight bleed parah. Stand ergonomis tilt/height/pivot lengkap dus asli.', 3950000, 6299000, 1, 3600000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 520, 11, 71, 'Banten', 'Tangerang Selatan', 'Serpong', '15310', 1, 'The Breeze BSD / AEON Mall BSD', '{"panel":"27 Inch QHD (2560 x 1440) Nano IPS 1ms GtG","refreshRate":"165Hz (O/C 180Hz) with G-Sync & FreeSync Premium","colorGamut":"DCI-P3 98% with VESA DisplayHDR 400","stand":"Height, Pivot, and Tilt Adjustable Stand"}', '2026-09-01T14:10:00Z', '2026-09-01T14:10:00Z'),
('item-56', 'usr-seller-3', 'cat-kamera', 'Sony Alpha 7 IV (A7 IV / ILCE-7M4) Body Only SC 3.5k Garansi Sony Mulus 98%', 'sony-alpha-7-iv-ilce-7m4-body-only-sc-3-5k', 'Kamera hybrid full-frame profesional Sony A7 IV (ILCE-7M4). Sensor Exmor R CMOS 33MP dan prosesor BIONZ XR super kencang. Autofokus Real-time Eye AF untuk manusia, hewan, dan burung. Rekaman video 4K 60p 10-bit 4:2:2 All-Intra dengan profil warna S-Cinetone. Shutter count sangat rendah 3.500 shot pemakaian foto studio dalam ruangan. Sensor bening, karet kencang. Garansi resmi Sony Indonesia.', 26800000, 36999000, 1, 25500000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","WITH_RECEIPT"]', 2024, '2026-11-30T00:00:00Z', 1, 'ACTIVE', 710, 12, 96, 'Jawa Timur', 'Surabaya', 'Gubeng', '60281', 1, 'Tunjungan Plaza Surabaya / Galaxy Mall', '{"sensor":"33.0 MP Full-Frame Exmor R Back-Illuminated CMOS","shutterCount":3500,"video":"4K 60p 10-bit 4:2:2 with S-Cinetone and S-Log3","stabilization":"5-Axis In-Body Image Stabilization 5.5 Stops"}', '2026-09-01T15:20:00Z', '2026-09-01T15:20:00Z'),
('item-57', 'usr-seller-3', 'cat-kamera', 'Lensa Sony FE 24-70mm F2.8 GM (G Master) SEL2470GM Optik Bening No Jamur', 'lensa-sony-fe-24-70mm-f2-8-gm-sel2470gm', 'Lensa zoom standar kasta tertinggi Sony G Master FE 24-70mm f/2.8 GM. Ketajaman luar biasa dari ujung ke ujung pada semua rentang fokal dengan bokeh bulat creamy khas GM berkat 9 bilah aperture sirkular. Motor Direct Drive SSM senyap dan presisi. Optik 100% bening bebas jamur, debu mikro sangat minim wajar. Selalu disimpan di dry cabinet elektrik. Lengkap pouch, lens hood asli, dan filter UV Hoya.', 17200000, 27999000, 1, 16000000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 460, 8, 54, 'Jawa Timur', 'Surabaya', 'Rungkut', '60293', 1, 'Galaxy Mall Surabaya / Pakuwon City', '{"focalLength":"24-70mm Full-Frame E-Mount","aperture":"Constant F2.8 Maximum Aperture","glass":"XA (Extreme Aspherical) Element with Nano AR Coating","filterSize":"82mm"}', '2026-09-01T16:15:00Z', '2026-09-01T16:15:00Z'),
('item-58', 'usr-seller-8', 'cat-kamera', 'GoPro HERO 12 Black Creator Edition Paket 3 Baterai Enduro + Media Mod Mulus', 'gopro-hero-12-black-creator-edition-paket-lengkap', 'Action camera flagship GoPro HERO 12 Black paket Creator Edition terlengkap. Mendukung perekaman video HDR 5.3K 60fps dan 4K 120fps dengan stabilisasi HyperSmooth 6.0 pemenang Emmy Award dan 360° Horizon Lock. Paket termasuk Media Mod (mikrofon directional + port 3.5mm), Volta Hand Grip baterai built-in + remote nirkabel, Light Mod lampu LED, dan total 3 buah baterai Enduro tahan dingin. Kondisi fisik 98% istimewa.', 5600000, 8499000, 1, 5100000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 520, 9, 63, 'Bali', 'Denpasar', 'Denpasar Selatan (Sanur)', '80227', 1, 'Icon Bali Sanur / Living World Denpasar', '{"resolution":"5.3K 60fps & 4K 120fps with HDR Video","stabilization":"HyperSmooth 6.0 with 360 Horizon Lock","accessories":"Volta Battery Grip, Media Mod, Light Mod, 3x Enduro Battery","waterproof":"10m Water Resistance Without Housing"}', '2026-09-01T17:00:00Z', '2026-09-01T17:00:00Z'),
('item-59', 'usr-seller-5', 'cat-game', 'ASUS ROG Ally Z1 Extreme 512GB Handheld Gaming Windows 11 Fullset Mulus 98%', 'asus-rog-ally-z1-extreme-512gb-handheld-windows-11', 'Konsol handheld PC gaming terkuat ASUS ROG Ally varian tertinggi AMD Ryzen Z1 Extreme (8 Cores / 16 Threads, 8.6 TFlops RDNA 3). Layar sentuh 7 inci FHD 120Hz 500 nits dengan teknologi AMD FreeSync Premium. Menjalankan sistem operasi Windows 11 resmi, bisa main semua game dari Steam, Xbox Game Pass, Epic Games, EA Play, dan Battle.net tanpa batasan. Fisik 98% like new no minus no lecet. Fullset dus box adaptor 65W asli.', 7800000, 11299000, 1, 7300000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 690, 16, 89, 'Banten', 'Tangerang Selatan', 'Serpong (BSD)', '15310', 1, 'AEON Mall BSD / The Breeze BSD', '{"processor":"AMD Ryzen Z1 Extreme with RDNA 3 Graphics","display":"7.0\" FHD (1920x1080) 120Hz 500 Nits 100% sRGB FreeSync","ram":"16 GB LPDDR5 6400MHz Dual Channel","storage":"512 GB PCIe 4.0 NVMe M.2 2230 SSD","os":"Windows 11 Home Original"}', '2026-09-01T18:00:00Z', '2026-09-01T18:00:00Z'),
('item-60', 'usr-seller-5', 'cat-game', 'Nintendo Switch V2 Neon Red Blue 32GB + MicroSD 128GB Fullset Mulus No Drift', 'nintendo-switch-v2-neon-red-blue-microsd-128gb', 'Nintendo Switch V2 (baterai lebih awet seri HAC-001(-01)) warna Neon Red Blue. Kondisi fisik 95% pemakaian apik dalam ruangan. Layar terpasang tempered glass dari baru, tombol dan analog Joy-Con 100% normal no drifting. Kelengkapan sangat lengkap: Tablet unit, Joycon pasang, Dock TV, Grip Joycon, Strap, Adaptor charger asli Nintendo, Kabel HDMI, plus bonus MicroSD Sandisk 128GB.', 2750000, 4199000, 1, 2500000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 0, 'ACTIVE', 480, 9, 56, 'Banten', 'Tangerang Selatan', 'Pondok Aren (Bintaro)', '15224', 1, 'Bintaro Xchange Mall / Bintaro Plaza', '{"model":"HAC-001(-01) V2 Extended Battery Life","storage":"32 GB Internal + 128 GB MicroSD Sandisk","batteryLife":"4.5 to 9 Hours of Gaming","controllers":"Left & Right Neon Joy-Con (Calibrated No Drift)"}', '2026-09-01T19:00:00Z', '2026-09-01T19:00:00Z'),
('item-61', 'usr-seller-8', 'cat-audio', 'Bose QuietComfort 45 (QC45) Wireless Noise Cancelling Headphones Triple Black', 'bose-quietcomfort-45-qc45-wireless-triple-black', 'Headphone peredam bising paling nyaman di telinga Bose QuietComfort 45 warna Triple Black. Kualitas active noise cancelling legendaris Bose mampu mengheningkan suara bising kantor dan pesawat dengan instan. Bantal telinga kulit sintesis sangat empuk tanpa tekanan di kepala meski dipakai berjam-jam. Baterai tahan hingga 24 jam. Lengkap hard carrying case, kabel charger type-C, dan kabel aux audio asli.', 3450000, 5299000, 1, 3100000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 490, 8, 64, 'Bali', 'Denpasar', 'Denpasar Barat', '80119', 1, 'Level 21 Mall Denpasar / Mall Bali Galeria', '{"batteryLife":"Up to 24 Hours on a Single Charge","modes":"Quiet Mode (Full ANC) and Aware Mode (Transparency)","charging":"USB-C Quick Charge 15 mins for 3 hours","cushions":"Plush Synthetic Leather Earcups with Minimal Clamping Force"}', '2026-09-01T20:10:00Z', '2026-09-01T20:10:00Z'),
('item-62', 'usr-seller-8', 'cat-audio', 'Speaker Bluetooth JBL Charge 5 Waterproof IP67 Original Garansi IMS Mulus', 'speaker-bluetooth-jbl-charge-5-waterproof-ip67-original', 'Speaker portable bertenaga JBL Charge 5 Original garansi PT Inti Megah Swara (IMS). Suara bass khas JBL Original Pro Sound menggelegar berkat racetrack driver terpisah, tweeter independen, dan dual passive bass radiator. Sertifikasi tahan air & debu IP67 aman dibawa ke pantai atau kolam renang. Baterai tahan hingga 20 jam dan bisa dijadikan powerbank pengisi daya smartphone. Dus box lengkap.', 1750000, 2799000, 1, 1550000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 420, 7, 49, 'Bali', 'Denpasar', 'Denpasar Timur', '80237', 1, 'Living World Denpasar / Plaza Renon', '{"outputPower":"40 Watts RMS (30W Woofer + 10W Tweeter)","batteryLife":"Up to 20 Hours of Playtime with Powerbank Function","durability":"IP67 Waterproof and Dustproof","connectivity":"Bluetooth 5.1 with PartyBoost Multi-Speaker Pairing"}', '2026-09-01T21:00:00Z', '2026-09-01T21:00:00Z'),
('item-63', 'usr-seller-10', 'cat-elektronik', 'Kulkas 2 Pintu Samsung RT38 Inverter All-Around Cooling 385L Black Inox Mulus', 'kulkas-2-pintu-samsung-rt38-inverter-385l-black-inox', 'Kulkas 2 pintu hemat energi Samsung RT38K503JS8 kapasitas besar 385 Liter warna Black Inox elegan anti sidik jari. Teknologi Digital Inverter hemat listrik dan hening dengan All-Around Cooling yang menjaga kesegaran makanan merata di setiap rak. Dilengkapi Deodorizing Filter karbon aktif penyerap bau tak sedap dan rak tempered glass kokoh menahan beban berat. Kondisi 96% sangat bersih dan terawat.', 4800000, 7699000, 1, 4300000, 'USED_EXCELLENT', '["UNIT_ONLY"]', 2023, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 390, 6, 42, 'Sulawesi Selatan', 'Makassar', 'Panakkukang', '90231', 1, 'Mall Panakkukang / Ambil Langsung di Rumah Penjual', '{"capacity":"385 Liters Gross / 368 Liters Net","compressor":"Digital Inverter Compressor with 20-Year Warranty","coolingSystem":"All-Around Cooling Even Temperature","shelves":"Toughened Tempered Glass Shelves up to 150kg"}', '2026-09-01T21:45:00Z', '2026-09-01T21:45:00Z'),
('item-64', 'usr-seller-6', 'cat-elektronik', 'Xiaomi Smart Air Purifier 4 Pro HEPA Filter OLED Touch Display Mulus Garansi', 'xiaomi-smart-air-purifier-4-pro-hepa-filter-oled', 'Pembersih udara ruangan terbaik Xiaomi Smart Air Purifier 4 Pro. Kapasitas jangkauan luas hingga 60 m² dengan CADR partikel 500 m³/jam, menyaring asap, debu halus PM2.5, bulu hewan, dan serbuk sari hingga 99.97%. Dilengkapi sensor laser presisi ganda PM2.5/PM10 dan layar sentuh OLED yang menampilkan kualitas udara secara real-time. Bisa dikontrol lewat aplikasi Xiaomi Home di smartphone. Filter masih 88% sehat, bodi mulus tanpa baret. Fullset dus buku bawaan.', 1950000, 3499000, 1, 1750000, 'LIKE_NEW', '["FULLSET","BOX_UNIT"]', 2024, NULL, 1, 'ACTIVE', 460, 8, 55, 'Jawa Tengah', 'Semarang', 'Candisari', '50257', 1, 'The Park Mall Semarang / Paragon Mall', '{"coverageArea":"Up to 60 Square Meters","cadr":"500 m³/h Particle CADR with 99.97% 3-in-1 HEPA Filtration","display":"OLED Touch Screen with Real-Time Air Quality Ring","connectivity":"Wi-Fi Smart App Control via Xiaomi Home"}', '2026-09-01T22:30:00Z', '2026-09-01T22:30:00Z');

